# Allocations the original console tutorial (ported/tutorial, imported
# verbatim) never frees: task input constraints, DiggerItemHint's item list
# and a look-at popup message. A few hundred bytes per tutorial session.
leak:InfoTask::InfoTask
leak:ChoiceTask::ChoiceTask
leak:DiggerItemHint::DiggerItemHint
leak:LookAtTileHint::onLookAt
# The popup message Tutorial keeps as m_lastMessage; its destructor never
# frees the final one.
leak:Tutorial::tick
# Headless sanitizer runs of the client (Xvfb + Mesa): the software GL
# driver's own allocations, reached only through libz.
leak:libz.so
